{"v":2,"id":"01M8DTYVAMQZTGH0VWH12YTYNP","ts":"2026-11-27T06:26:51.348556Z","actor":"owner","type":"goal.add","node":"01M8DTYVAMQZTGH0VWH12YTYNP","payload":{"role":"owner","words":"For each Probe run, hyp keeps the steps the subject's hyp really took, in the fixed step format any application can write, and shows them with the run's Result.","base":"1bf143cc8aa389c6e85cc281c5204729ce807d0c","base_tree":"cf7b7301e538f1a85adae00a59f2d89cf1c5119e","budget":3,"from":"","lines":[{"key":"line-1","text":"After a Probe run whose subject's hyp takes acts, the clone's trace holds one step log for that run, with one line for each event the subject's hyp wrote, in order, and the run's Result carries the step log's hash.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-2","text":"hyp show of that Result prints its step log.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-3","text":"hyp run with HYP_STEP_LOG set appends step \u003cAction\u003e \u003cjson\u003e, one line for each event it writes, and appends nothing for a command that writes no event, such as hyp spec.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-4","text":"hyp spec states the step format: one step per line, step \u003cAction\u003e \u003cjson\u003e, append only, and no effect when HYP_STEP_LOG is unset.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-5","text":"With HYP_STEP_LOG unset, hyp itself appends no step line anywhere, and apart from the step log of a Probe run, every hyp command prints and writes the same as on H0.","kind":"guard"}],"examples":[{"line":"line-1","example":"a","hash":"1771f38257edb665dcb9d2d83035b12f2f310e72","h0":{"commit":"1bf143cc8aa389c6e85cc281c5204729ce807d0c","row_tree":"cf7b7301e538f1a85adae00a59f2d89cf1c5119e","probe":"2890346b01f4069359c5b941c0b9753ff4ca51fe","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-1","example":"b","hash":"7163410f3a9b2c9e8e1aa337468bb2193a771346","h0":{"commit":"1bf143cc8aa389c6e85cc281c5204729ce807d0c","row_tree":"cf7b7301e538f1a85adae00a59f2d89cf1c5119e","probe":"2b0adcf7f9d66d1d480e6e9ea2fd8e94ab41a67f","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},